          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One-piece central threaded post provides immediate baseplate fixation</li>\n<li>Plasma spray coating creates long-term baseplate fixation<br>\n</li>\n<li>Variable locking screws designed for baseplate fixation<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
